{"route":"/docs/6.0/content/images/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Images","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for opting images into responsive behavior (so they never become wider than their parent) and add lightweight styles to them—all via classes."},"blocks":[{"id":"responsive-images","type":"heading","en":"Responsive images","level":2},{"id":"responsive-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Images in Bootstrap are made responsive with <code>.img-fluid</code>. This applies <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>height: auto;</code> to the image so that it scales with the parent width."},{"id":"responsive-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"76d47989c457a00372f6","height":300},{"id":"responsive-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"...\">","language":""},{"id":"image-thumbnails","type":"heading","en":"Image thumbnails","level":2},{"id":"image-thumbnails--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/border\">border-radius utilities</a>, you can use <code>.img-thumbnail</code> to give an image a rounded 1px border appearance."},{"id":"image-thumbnails--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b9c113585b8fc60dd4df","height":147},{"id":"image-thumbnails--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"img-thumbnail\" alt=\"...\">","language":""},{"id":"aligning-images","type":"heading","en":"Aligning images","level":2},{"id":"aligning-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Align images with the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/float\">helper float classes</a> or <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/text-alignment\">text alignment classes</a>. <code>block</code>-level images can be centered using <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/margin#horizontal-centering\">the <code>.mx-auto</code> margin utility class</a>."},{"id":"aligning-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"71098278a5e0f9233391","height":174},{"id":"aligning-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-start\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-end\" alt=\"...\">","language":""},{"id":"aligning-images--example-2","type":"demo","key":"fa3fa6f0c52c97502c06","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-2","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded mx-auto d-block\" alt=\"...\">","language":""},{"id":"aligning-images--example-3","type":"demo","key":"a32ff21a218bf5dabc6a","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-3","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"text-center\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"figures","type":"heading","en":"Figures","level":2},{"id":"figures--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Anytime you need to display a piece of content—like an image with an optional caption, consider using a <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> element. Figures are flex containers in Bootstrap, so you can easily modify the layout and alignment with our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/flex\">flex utilities</a>."},{"id":"figures--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the included <code>.figure</code> and <code>.figure-caption</code> classes to provide some baseline styles for the HTML5 <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code> elements. Images in figures have no explicit size, so be sure to add the <code>.img-fluid</code> class to your <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> to make it responsive."},{"id":"figures--example-1","type":"demo","key":"bcf6e971a622f8b60c38","height":147},{"id":"figures--code-1","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid rounded-3\" alt=\"...\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":""},{"id":"figures--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"And with a reverse alignment:"},{"id":"figures--example-2","type":"demo","key":"260d48429c2f828cc7e6","height":147},{"id":"figures--code-2","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure align-items-end\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid rounded-3\" alt=\"...\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":""},{"id":"picture","type":"heading","en":"Picture","level":2},{"id":"picture--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If you are using the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> element to specify multiple <code>&lt;source&gt;</code> elements for a specific <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>, make sure to add the <code>.img-*</code> classes to the <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> and not to the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> tag."},{"id":"picture--code-1","type":"code","value":"<picture>\n  <source srcset=\"...\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" alt=\"...\">\n</picture>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Images use local CSS variables on <code>.img-thumbnail</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$thumbnail-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --thumbnail-padding: .25rem,\n    --thumbnail-bg: var(--bg-body),\n    --thumbnail-border-width: var(--border-width),\n    --thumbnail-border-color: var(--border-color),\n    --thumbnail-border-radius: var(--radius-5),\n    --thumbnail-box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-sm),\n  ),\n  $thumbnail-tokens\n);","language":""},{"id":"variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"And for figures as well:"},{"id":"variables--code-2","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$figure-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --figure-gap: calc(var(--spacer) * .5),\n    --figure-caption-font-size: var(--font-size-sm),\n    --figure-caption-color: var(--fg-3),\n  ),\n  $figure-tokens\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"76d47989c457a00372f6","html":"<svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: Responsive image\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img bd-placeholder-img-lg img-fluid\" height=\"250\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"var(--bs-bg-2)\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"var(--bs-fg-4)\" dy=\".3em\">Responsive image</text></svg>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b9c113585b8fc60dd4df","html":"<svg aria-label=\"A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img img-thumbnail\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"var(--bs-bg-2)\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"var(--bs-fg-4)\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"71098278a5e0f9233391","html":"<svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-start\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"var(--bs-bg-2)\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"var(--bs-fg-4)\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n<svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-end\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"var(--bs-bg-2)\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"var(--bs-fg-4)\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fa3fa6f0c52c97502c06","html":"<svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded mx-auto d-block\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"var(--bs-bg-2)\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"var(--bs-fg-4)\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a32ff21a218bf5dabc6a","html":"<div class=\"text-center\">\n  <svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"var(--bs-bg-2)\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"var(--bs-fg-4)\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"bcf6e971a622f8b60c38","html":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 400x300\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img img-fluid rounded-3\" height=\"300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"var(--bs-bg-2)\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"var(--bs-fg-4)\" dy=\".3em\">400x300</text></svg>\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"260d48429c2f828cc7e6","html":"<figure class=\"figure align-items-end\"><!-- [!code highlight] -